\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.14}{\ignorespaces Ratio of HG20+02 to HG00 as the transmission of the SRM is increased for a mode mismatch between the arm cavity and the SRC. The interferometer is in RSE mode. A mode mismatch was introduced by setting the focal length of SR3 to be 12\tmspace  +\thinmuskip {.1667em}mm shorter than the nominal amount.\relax }}{51}{figure.caption.73}}
\newlabel{fig:srmthgratio}{{2.14}{51}{Ratio of HG20+02 to HG00 as the transmission of the SRM is increased for a mode mismatch between the arm cavity and the SRC. The interferometer is in RSE mode. A mode mismatch was introduced by setting the focal length of SR3 to be 12\,mm shorter than the nominal amount.\relax }{figure.caption.73}{}}
